!! Provenance & Rites

* ''Source:'' https://fuckup.solutions/DOA.html (live site, self-contained); Wayback captures of
  http://www.neuroatomic.com/ for the 2003 originals. Fetched 2026-08-14, operator-approved manual
  session, wget verbatim bytes.
* ''Lineage:'' DOA.exe by the NeuroAtomic Order of the Nevermind Cabal (~2001–2003) → web
  AppleKation re-creation at fuckup.solutions → thrown daily by the 23 Apples of Eris cabal →
  this shelf.
* ''No source repository exists on any public forge'' (code search on "E-Jing-A-Ling",
  "Pentatorah", "NeuroAtomic", "fuckup.solutions" — 2026-08-14, no hits). The inline script in
  DOA.html stands as the source of record.
* ''License:'' Kopyleft — "(K) Copyright Is Reversed. Reprint" (stated in DOA.html itself).
* ''Open marks:'' DOA.exe lands at exactly 128 KiB — period packer artifact or Wayback truncation
  at a power-of-two boundary; unrun, untested — collide under Wine before trusting the binary.
* ''Crawl intent (operator-declared):'' the library means to capture
  `fuckup.solutions/index3.html` and its outgoing linked pages (the wider site beyond DOA's
  dependency tree), and `https://www.libraryoferis.org/` — both bound for the same CAS-bytes /
  bag-handle shape this reliquary holds. Uncaptured yet; this handle gains sibling handles when
  the crawls land.

